% Original pentatonic tunes written for this course, released to the public
% domain (CC0). Each stays within a 6th, leaps no further than a 5th, and uses
% beats and half beats, so it sits at level 2; each brings in one thing: a
% rest, a waltz, the low so, pairs of eighths, a call and answer.
% Chord symbols give the backing track something to play.

